			"notes": "New features, bugs and exploits patched, and more!\n\n## Changes/Fixes\n\n- Vendors in buy mode no longer require permits.\n- Added new commands to give, claim, and unclaim permits.\n- Added a creative tab.\n\n## Known Issues\n\n- Switching vendor modes can be glitchy. I'm not sure if this is Permitted's fault.\n  Workaround: Exit the vendor menu right after changing the mode, and then re-open it."
		},
